From b06899f5e316741a5f8c1a86622488c0a25a4799 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ServerOmega <69215510+ServerOmega@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 07:31:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] View Card: Stats tab (VS Mobile style per-card and per-suit
 stats)

New first tab on View Card, read-only, card owner only (same access code + chip id check as the battle history),
GET ui/card-stats/get-card-stats/{accessCode}/{chipId}. No schema change; reads existing tables:
- Win rate by mode: Total, Offline (solo + team), Class solo, Class team, Mix, Fes, Other (win/loss record).
- Totals (damage, avg damage, kills, no-damage battles, EX burst damage, Class 10-win streaks) and burst types.
- Sortable per-suit table: lifetime per-suit stats for "All modes", battle-history split for a single mode;
  battles, wins, losses, win rate, avg damage dealt / taken, kills, kills per battle, no-damage battles,
  EX burst damage, last played. Names / cost from wwwroot/data/MobileSuits.json.
- Recent 30 battles: date, mode, suit, result, damage dealt / taken, time.
The response carries no card identifiers. English strings (neutral + en-US resources; other languages fall back).

Tests/Server.Tests: +9 (CardStatsTests), 24/24. Matchmaking.Tests 423/423, cross-server e2e 103/103.

Co-authored-by: Grok Bot <grok-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
